          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Tracking your cycle and caring for your overall health may help you feel more prepared:</p><ul><li>Track your periods and symptoms with an app or diary.</li><li>Keep period products on hand for unexpected bleeding.</li><li>Eat iron-rich foods if your periods are heavy.</li><li>Manage stress with rest and relaxation.</li><li>Talk to your doctor about any sudden or significant changes.</li></ul>",
