        "text_XkNNxY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Finding the right support for irregular periods starts with understanding what may be affecting your cycle. Thoughtfully selected wellness products and nutritional supplements may help support overall well-being, particularly when combined with balanced nutrition, stress management, and healthy daily habits.</p><p>During perimenopause, hormonal fluctuations commonly lead to changes in cycle length and flow. Depending on your individual needs, certain nutritional supplements may help address specific nutritional gaps, such as iron, or support general health.</p>",
